[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Quick System Runtime Setup
Name[zh_CN]=快速配置系统运行时
Comment=Configure capability bundles, runtimes, and development components
Comment[zh_CN]=配置能力合集、运行时和开发组件
